===Etymology===
From the Arabic {{term|sc=Arab|جاهلية||tr=jahilíyya|ignorance|lang=ar}}.

===Noun===
{{infl|en|noun}}

# {{Islam}} The age of [[ignorance]], [[barbarism]] and [[unbelief]] in [[Arabia]] before the coming of [[Islam]]; more recently its meaning has been expanded to mean [[Western]] non-Muslims.

